s activation; pm-oll8 and pm-tom5xp (closed) own declared type validation, not cross-package conflicts."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":3},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:sdk","extensions","schema","ux"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-27T03:33:33.880Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-27T03:33:33.880Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":90},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Activation keeps the first declaration of a field and drops each later declaration with a different type, with a warning that names both packages, the field and both types; pm package doctor and pm health report the conflict, and create and update keep working for every field; A spec activates two such packages and drives create and update, with a negative control on a hand-built registry"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-ugqx"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"One package's field declaration cannot stop writes for the whole tracker"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Every create and update exits 2 with extension_item_field_type_conflict while both packages are active"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-dhlij3","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-11-27T03:33:33.880Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"7d02ac661402cbec1d7b22da08e2e0f6b9097b8a67296608feec930bbe08acef","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_o